  partName: Front Engine Cover
  description: The Front Engine Cover is a tiny, thin-flat component positioned at
    the top-center-front of the engine, protecting the engine's front section from
    debris and damage. Made of Material.006, this cover plays a crucial role in maintaining
    the engine's overall integrity. Notably, the Front Engine Cover is designed to
    be easily removable, allowing for convenient access to the engine's front section
    for maintenance and repairs.
